{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774006450,"nonce":"UbTrd3hbO0Ef3/qFj3O8ucvIMWQ=","title":"Template versioning and `nightshift upgrade` for WORKFLOW.md","message":"When `nightshift init` scaffolds WORKFLOW.md, the file becomes project-owned with no link to upstream. Prompt improvements (e.g. the bug-fixing protocol added in 642424c) don't reach existing projects.\n\n## Proposed solution\n\n1. Add a `template_version: \u003cint\u003e` field to the WORKFLOW.md YAML front matter. `nightshift init` sets it to the current version. Missing `template_version` is treated as version 0 (predates versioning).\n\n2. Ship the canonical template inside agent-worker (e.g. `templates/WORKFLOW.md`) with its own `template_version`.\n\n3. Add a `nightshift upgrade` CLI command that:\n   - Reads the project's WORKFLOW.md `template_version` (missing = 0)\n   - Compares against the shipped template version\n   - If behind, shows a unified diff of the **prompt section only** (below the `---` closing fence) — YAML config is never touched\n   - With `--apply`: patches the prompt section, bumps `template_version`, preserves YAML config\n   - With `--dry-run` (default): just shows the diff and exits\n\n4. On `nightshift init`, if WORKFLOW.md already exists and is behind, print a one-line hint: \"Run `nightshift upgrade` to see prompt updates.\"\n\n## Out of scope\n- Auto-upgrading YAML config (too risky — users customize adapters, hooks, merge policy)\n- Layered/inherited templates (future work for SaaS)\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] WORKFLOW.md front matter includes `template_version: 1`\n- [ ] Canonical template lives in `templates/WORKFLOW.md`\n- [ ] `nightshift upgrade --dry-run` shows diff when behind, \"up to date\" when current\n- [ ] `nightshift upgrade --apply` patches prompt section, bumps version, preserves YAML\n- [ ] `nightshift init` warns if existing WORKFLOW.md is behind\n- [ ] Tests for version comparison, diff generation, and apply logic\n- [ ] Missing `template_version` treated as version 0","files":null}]}